{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "On The Wind's Breath",
    "steam_appid": 2393330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393330/extras/c3a364ed1b64c17b0a8750ad8f05807a.avif?t=1754321275\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help a single dandelion seed find its place to grow on a journey across the world, in this serene yet precise, hand-crafted platformer from Pink Sakura Studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touching, wordless adventure about finding your place in the world, told through the simple, elegant journey of a single seed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and varied world to explore, from frozen caverns to sun-scorched plains, filled with challenging routes and hidden groves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful and calming soundtrack, featuring hours of original music with gentle piano melodies and ethereal soundscapes to lose yourself in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are minimalist and intuitive - simply drift, float, and harness the breeze - but with layers of expressive depth to master, where every current is an opportunity. Frequent checkpoints let you ride the wind again and again as you learn to navigate the world's beauty and its dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time, little seed. Just let go. The wind will carry you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393330/extras/c3a364ed1b64c17b0a8750ad8f05807a.avif?t=1754321275\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help a single dandelion seed find its place to grow on a journey across the world, in this serene yet precise, hand-crafted platformer from Pink Sakura Studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touching, wordless adventure about finding your place in the world, told through the simple, elegant journey of a single seed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and varied world to explore, from frozen caverns to sun-scorched plains, filled with challenging routes and hidden groves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful and calming soundtrack, featuring hours of original music with gentle piano melodies and ethereal soundscapes to lose yourself in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are minimalist and intuitive - simply drift, float, and harness the breeze - but with layers of expressive depth to master, where every current is an opportunity. Frequent checkpoints let you ride the wind again and again as you learn to navigate the world's beauty and its dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time, little seed. Just let go. The wind will carry you.</p>",
    "short_description": "In \u201cOn the Wind's Breath\u201d, play as a dandelion seed, navigate obstacles, find fertile soil, take control of the wind, grow into a flower. Simple graphics, intuitive controls, narrative experience. Beware of unsuitable surfaces. Soothing soundtrack, a journey through various regions.",
